26:["$","section",null,{"className":"relative px-6 border-t border-border/60 py-28","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]","children":[["$","$L19",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto mb-12 max-w-[680px] text-center","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand mb-4","children":"FAQ"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-balance text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-5xl","children":"Frequently asked questions"}]]}]}],["$","$L19",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-[840px]","children":[["$","$L3c",null,{"items":[{"q":"What is Forge?","a":"A high-performance build cache and remote execution system designed to accelerate compilation and testing while cutting infrastructure spend."},{"q":"How do I set up Forge?","a":"Deploy it as a Docker image — the documentation walks through every step, from a single-node local setup to a multi-region cluster."},{"q":"What operating systems are supported?","a":"Linux, macOS, and Windows for clients. Linux and macOS for the server. Workers can target any platform your toolchains support."},{"q":"Is Forge free?","a":"Most of the monorepo is FSL-1.1-Apache-2.0. Individual cache use does not need a commercial license. Metrics and remote persistent workers are Business Source License modules; Enterprise or a very inexpensive separate license covers shared production use."},{"q":"Why Rust?","a":"Memory safety without garbage collection. No mystery pauses, no race conditions at scale, no runtime tax — which is how a single Forge cluster serves over ten billion requests a month."},{"q":"How does remote execution work?","a":"Forge distributes build and test actions across a network of workers. The scheduler decides who runs what, hermetically, and content-addresses every input and output."},{"q":"Does it work with my existing tools?","a":"Yes. Anything that speaks the Remote Execution API — Bazel, Buck2, Siso, Goma, Pants, or CMake via recc — works without modification."},{"q":"How do I keep my Bazel setup hermetic?","a":"Forge eliminates external dependencies and enforces consistency across builds. The docs cover the configuration in depth."},{"q":"Why should I choose Forge?","a":"Trusted by some of the largest engineering organizations in the world for cutting both build wall-time and CI compute cost. Handles over one billion requests a month, designed for scale."}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 text-center text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":["For more details, see the"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/docs","className":"text-brand underline-offset-4 hover:underline","children":"Forge documentation"}],"."]}]]}]}]]}]}]
